#. type: Title =
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/deployment/docker.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Running in Docker"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/deployment/docker.adoc
msgid ""
"The first steps are described in xref:edge/deploy/docker.adoc[Deploy OpenEMS "
"Edge to Docker], xref:backend/deploy/docker.adoc[Deploy OpenEMS Backend to "
"Docker] and xref:ui/deploy/docker.adoc[Deploy the UI with Docker]. This page "
"adds what happens inside the images: structure, start sequence, ports, "
"volumes, environment variables, how to build and replace parts, and known "
"pitfalls."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/deployment/docker.adoc
msgid ""
"The statements are derived from the files under `+tools/docker/+` and the "
"Java code. Where something was tried out, it says so."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/deployment/docker.adoc
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/systems/fenecon-home-battery.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/deployment/docker.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Image (Docker Hub)\n"
"| Dockerfile\n"
"| Content\n"
"| Ports in the container\n"
"\n"
"| `+openems/edge+`\n"
"| `+tools/docker/edge/Dockerfile+`\n"
"| OpenEMS Edge (`+openems-edge.jar+`)\n"
"| 8080 Apache Felix Web Console, 8085 Websocket for the UI\n"
"| `+openems/ui-edge+`\n"
"| `+tools/docker/ui/Dockerfile.edge+`\n"
"| Angular UI {plus} nginx, proxy to an Edge\n"
"| 80, 443\n"
"| `+openems/backend+`\n"
"| `+tools/docker/backend/Dockerfile+`\n"
"| central Backend with Edge Manager\n"
"| 8079 Apache Felix Web Console, 8082 UI Websocket, 8083 Edge Manager\n"
"| `+openems/backend-edge+`\n"
"| `+tools/docker/backend-edge/Dockerfile+`\n"
"| Backend Edge Application, to which the Edges connect\n"
"| 8078 Apache Felix Web Console, 8081 Edge Websocket\n"
"| `+openems/ui-backend+`\n"
"| `+tools/docker/ui/Dockerfile.backend+`\n"
"| Angular UI {plus} nginx, proxy to the Backend\n"
"| 80, 443\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/deployment/docker.adoc
msgid ""
"In addition, there is `+.devcontainer/+` (development environment for VS "
"Code: JDK 25, Node.js 22, Angular CLI) and `+.gitpod.Dockerfile+` or `+tools/"
"gitpod/+` for Gitpod. These images are for development, not for operation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/deployment/docker.adoc
